1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:05,607
When you buy a pair of limited sneakers, a graphics card or a watch,

2
00:00:05,657 --> 00:00:13,938
you have to take the seller's word that it is real, and once it is resold, nobody can prove where it came from.

3
00:00:13,988 --> 00:00:19,762
Counterfeit goods move over five hundred billion dollars a year.

4
00:00:19,812 --> 00:00:24,802
A serial number or a QR printed on a box can be copied.

5
00:00:24,852 --> 00:00:31,290
What cannot be copied is a secret sealed inside the box that only appears when it is opened.

6
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:38,802
So every unit gets two QRs: a public one to verify, and a sealed one to claim it.

7
00:00:38,852 --> 00:00:43,258
After buying, the customer opens the box and scans the secret QR,

8
00:00:43,308 --> 00:00:50,618
signs in with an email, and the product and its warranty are theirs on Solana.

9
00:00:50,668 --> 00:00:54,298
If they resell it, ownership moves with it.

10
00:00:54,348 --> 00:00:59,650
Each unit is an account in our Anchor program on devnet.

11
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:06,634
The seal is checked on-chain with Solana's native ed25519 verification,

12
00:01:06,684 --> 00:01:09,338
so it can only be claimed once.

13
00:01:09,388 --> 00:01:13,242
We pay the fees, so buyers never need SOL.

14
00:01:13,292 --> 00:01:20,708
We focus on high-value products that are not mass-produced:
sneakers, electronics, watches, perfume, wine.

15
00:01:20,758 --> 00:01:23,906
We start with wineries in Cafayate, Salta,

16
00:01:23,956 --> 00:01:29,810
where lot traceability for export gives us a concrete entry point.

17
00:01:29,860 --> 00:01:33,626
We charge per registered product, paid in USDC.

18
00:01:33,676 --> 00:01:39,594
I built the Solana program and the backend, Jorge the company panel, and Emanuel the landing.

19
00:01:39,644 --> 00:01:42,338
Jorge and I come from Argentina Builders,

20
00:01:42,388 --> 00:01:47,866
and we're based in Salta, a few hours from the Cafayate wineries we start with.

21
00:01:47,916 --> 00:01:56,466
Our next step is a pilot with a first brand labeling real products, measuring how many buyers verify and claim them.

22
00:01:56,516 --> 00:01:57,084
Thank you.

